  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "T’es d’la Team MZ, toi, j’me trompe ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054201900650073002000642019006C00610020005400650061006D0020004D005A002C00200074006F0069002C0020006A2019006D0065002000740072006F006D007000650020003F001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est d’toi dont tout le clan parle ?\nJ’ai bien envie d’tester mes skills contre toi.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Un combat, ça t’dit ?\nAllez vas-y, te fais pas prier.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0055006E00200063006F006D006200610074002C002000E700610020007420190064006900740020003F000A0041006C006C0065007A0020007600610073002D0079002C002000740065002000660061006900730020007000610073002000700072006900650072002E001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Reviens m’voir quand t’auras la motiv’ de t’battre.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00520065007600690065006E00730020006D20190076006F006900720020007100750061006E0064002000742019006100750072006100730020006C00610020006D006F0074006900762019002000640065002000742019006200610074007400720065002E001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0004>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00040000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "T’as l’air de vouloir en découdre ! Ça m’plaît !\nAlors, t’es prêt<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oui !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F00750069002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pas tout de suite.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00500061007300200074006F00750074002000640065002000730075006900740065002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "T’as des nerfs d’acier, mais pas autant qu’moi !\nTu vas dérouiller !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005420190061007300200064006500730020006E006500720066007300200064201900610063006900650072002C0020006D006100690073002000700061007300200061007500740061006E00740020007100752019006D006F006900200021000A0054007500200076006100730020006400E90072006F00750069006C006C0065007200200021001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "T’es sérieu<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȁxse ?\nLa prochaine fois, t’as intérêt à dire oui !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00542019006500730020007300E9007200690065007500100003110000FF02010078007300650020003F000A004C0061002000700072006F0063006800610069006E006500200066006F00690073002C0020007420190061007300200069006E007400E9007200EA0074002000E0002000640069007200650020006F0075006900200021001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu m’as peut-être battue, mais j’te pardonne.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400750020006D20190061007300200070006500750074002D00EA0074007200650020006200610074007400750065002C0020006D0061006900730020006A20190074006500200070006100720064006F006E006E0065002E001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pour la peine, j’vais te raconter une histoire...\nSi, si, j’y tiens.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006F007500720020006C00610020007000650069006E0065002C0020006A201900760061006900730020007400650020007200610063006F006E00740065007200200075006E006500200068006900730074006F006900720065002E002E002E000A00530069002C002000730069002C0020006A201900790020007400690065006E0073002E001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "T’sais, l’acier, c’est insensible au poison.\nMais crois-moi, ça sort pas d’nulle part !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Gypso a connu Corvault quand ils étaient ados.\nC’était un p’tit frère pour lui, il le kiffait grave.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 105
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais Corvault, il est un peu toxique, t’as vu ?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nC’est un charmeur, mais des fois, il s’rend pas\ncompte que c’est lui-même qu’il empoisonne.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 147
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Gypso, lui, il est comme son Airmure. Il a un\nmental d’acier ! Il résiste au charme de son venin !<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nTu vois c’que je veux dire ? C’est une métaphore !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 157
    },
    {
      "displayText": "... J’raconte pas super bien... En tout cas, j’suis\nfière que le nº 2 de not’ clan soit un mec en or !<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n... Enfin, en acier. T’as pigé, quoi.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 148
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Allez, t’as gagné l’combat, et en plus je t’ai bien\ngavé<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe avec mon histoire. Alors, prends ça !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 105
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Corvault compte sur vous, la Team MZ !\nEt faut pas décevoir l’boss. Jamais.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 3120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Corvault compte sur vous, la Team MZ !\nEt faut pas décevoir l’boss. Jamais.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
